# Satr oxirlari: repoda LF, Windows nusxasida git o'zi moslaydi (CRLF ogohlantirishlari chiqmaydi)
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.onnx binary
*.joblib binary
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
# Bulut panelining tayyor build fayllari o'zgarishsiz saqlansin (Windows CRLF almashtirishi Next.js RSC fayllarini buzadi)
cloud/panel_dist/** -text
